# MetaQuest

A comprehensive metagenomics analysis pipeline for taxonomic classification, pathogen detection, and functional annotation of microbial communities.

## Overview

MetaQuest is an integrated bioinformatics pipeline that addresses the complex challenges of metagenomic data analysis. By combining state-of-the-art tools and databases, MetaQuest provides researchers with a streamlined workflow for understanding microbial community composition, identifying potential pathogens, and assessing antimicrobial resistance profiles from sequencing data.

## 🏗️ **Modern Architecture**

MetaQuest follows a professional, modular architecture designed for maintainability, extensibility, and future integration with advanced libraries like scikit-bio:
MetaQuest/
├── src/metaquest/               # Main package (modern src/ layout)
│   ├── core/                   # Core analysis algorithms
│   │   ├── analysis.py         # Main analysis controller
│   │   ├── taxonomic_analysis.py  # Kraken2/BLAST taxonomy
│   │   ├── pathogen_analysis.py   # Pathogen detection
│   │   └── functional_analysis.py # Gene prediction & annotation
│   ├── ml/                     # Machine Learning components
│   │   ├── pathogen_predictor.py  # ML pathogen prediction
│   │   ├── feature_extractor.py   # Advanced feature engineering
│   │   └── model_artifacts/       # Pre-trained models
│   ├── io/                     # Input/Output processing
│   │   ├── file_validator.py      # Advanced file validation
│   │   └── utils.py               # Utility functions
│   ├── visualization/          # Interactive visualizations
│   │   └── visualization.py       # Plotly-based charts
│   └── reporting/              # Report generation
│       └── reporting.py           # HTML/JSON reports
├── examples/                   # Example input files
├── docs/                      # Comprehensive documentation
├── scripts/                   # Database setup scripts
├── environment/               # Conda environment files
└── databases/                 # Reference databases

