Installation Guide: Complete setup instructions with troubleshooting
Usage Guide: Comprehensive examples and parameter explanations
API Documentation: Developer reference for programmatic usage

🧬 Supported File Formats
Input Files

FASTQ: Single-end, paired-end, interleaved (compressed or uncompressed)
FASTA: Assembled genomes, contigs, gene sequences (compressed or uncompressed)

Output Formats

Reports: HTML (interactive), TXT (human-readable), JSON (machine-readable)
Data: CSV, TSV for downstream analysis
Visualizations: HTML with embedded JavaScript (Plotly)

